    "text": "Structure of Bromic acid:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/00a84a56-325b-4d09-a1ea-284efc472d4b-image.png\" style=\"width: 168px; height: 123px;\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HBrO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;(Bromic acid)<br />Oxidation State of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Br</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />Structure of Per-boric acid:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/aa286ce2-77ba-4bd8-ae37-69d52ad793d4-image.png\" style=\"width: 199px; height: 150px;\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HBrO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;(per bromic acid)<br />Oxidation&nbsp;state of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Br</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br />Thus, Sum of Oxidation state <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>",
